    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "TIMETABLE\nEffective July 2, 1984\nEASTERN\nWe earn our wings every day™\nSee Your Travel\nAgent for Eastern's\nGet-Up-and-Go\nPassport.",
      "TOLL FREE RESERVATIONS\nTELEPHONE NUMBERS\nsee pages 219 and 220\nTICKET OFFICES\nsee pages 221, 222\n223 and 224\nAddress Correction Requested\nSu\nMo\n1E\n2:\nSu\nMo\n16\n23\n30\n10\n17\n24\nJULY\nTu We\n11\n18\n25\n12\n19\n26\nL. TEMBER\nTu\nWe\nTh\n4\n11\n12\n18\n25\n19\n26\n13\n20\n27\nFr\n13\n20\n27\nSa\n14\n21\n28\nFr\n14\n21\n28\nSa\n15\n22\n29\nAUGUST\nSu Mo Tu We Th\n5\n12\n19\n26\nSu\n14\n21\n28\n6\n13\n20\n27\nMo\n15\n22\n29\n2\n14\n21\n28\n15\n22\n29\n16\n23\n30\nOCTOBER\nTu\nWe\nTh\n2\n16\n23\n30\n3\n10\n17\n24\n4\n11\n18\n25\n31\nFr\n10\n17\n24\n31\nFr\n5\n12\n19\n26\nSa\n11\n18\n25\nSa\n6\n13\n20\n27\nMIAMI, FLORIDA 33148\nAIRPORT\nMIAMI INTERNATIONAL\nEASTERN AIRLINES\nTom Livesey\n20685 Marion Rd.\nSaratoga,\n95070\nSFO\nATLANTA, GA.\nPermit No. 25\nBULK RATE\nU.S. POSTAGE\nPAID\nPrinted in U.S.A.\nSchedule and fares subject to change without notice."
